                "_key": "school-policies-intro-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Safety and wellbeing of every child is our highest priority. Our policies outline the measures we take to create a secure, respectful, and supportive environment for all students. These guidelines ensure that staff, students, and the wider community share a clear understanding of safeguarding expectations and responsibilities across all aspects of school life."
              }
            ],
            "style": "normal"
          }
